{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Logo\">Logo</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Login Logo On To ToDate User Users\">The <code>Logo</code> screen allows you to upload a logo which your users will see on your login screen.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Logo\">Accessing the Logo Screen</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Logo To ToDate User Users\">To access the <code>Logo</code> screen, go to the <code>Users</code> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 pb-6\"><div class=\"overflow-visible bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-neutral-100 shadow shadow-neutral-400\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 items-center mx-8 p-6 text-neutral-500 whitespace-nowrap bg-neutral-200 shadow-inner shadow-neutral-400\"><i class=\"text-base fas fa-people-group\"></i><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Users\">Users</span></span></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Image NewUser Next On To ToDate User\">Then click the image icon next to the <code>New User</code> button.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Logo\">Uploading Your Logo</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Code Date Image On Select To ToDate Update\">Select your image file and click the <code>Update</code> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><span class=\"border font-semibold rounded-md py-3 px-4 bg-[#5cb85c] border-[#4cae4c] text-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Update\">Update</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Image Less LessThan Size\">Your image must be in PNG format and less than 1 MB in size.</p>",
  "key": "logo-upload"
}
